{"id":"oprvkqezgao1jbbcq7uvfrtva","title":"某研究团队在 Nature Neuroscience 发表孕期血清素神经元调控食欲的分子机制","originalTitle":"孕期“嘴馋”，大脑里发生了什么？","summary":"某研究团队在 Nature Neuroscience 发表孕期血清素神经元调控食欲的分子机制。实验显示孕期小鼠中缝背核（DRN）血清素神经元放电频率降低，SK3钾离子通道活性增强导致神经元抑制，进而引发高糖高脂饲料摄入增加。通过敲除SK3和激活神经通路证实其调控作用，并发现该通路连接奖赏相关脑区腹侧被盖区。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"知识分子"},"links":{"original":"http://www.zhishifenzi.com/news/multiple/10758.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T03:02:42.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T10:31:23.854Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T10:31:23.854Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["研究成果","大模型","Nature"],"score":73,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}